sxml transform: --force replaces only files the command writes; give --output or --result-directory
Usage: sxml transform [--initial-mode=NAME] [--initial-template=NAME] [--method=METHOD] [--param=NAME=VALUE]... [--result-directory=DIR] [--collection=DIR] [--code-language=LIBRARY]... [--locations=WHEN] [--input-format=FORMAT] [--alignment=ALIGNMENT] [--preserve=LIST] [--fragment] [--strict] [--block-size=N] [--value-max-length=N] [--value-partition-capacity=N] [--schema=FILE] [--output=FILE] [--force] STYLESHEET [INPUT]
Try 'sxml transform --help'.
